  "description": "CR 700.4, 701.20a, 603.2h, 608.2c, 609.3: Part in Friendship reveals to a creature card when a nontoken creature its controller controls dies, once each turn, and puts it onto the battlefield if its mana value is at most her land count, else into her hand, the rest to the bottom",
  "note": "alice controls three Mountains; bob's Forest is no land of hers. Turn 1: her token Bears dying triggers nothing; her Grizzly Bears dying reveals Island, Forest and Hill Giant, whose mana value 4 exceeds her 3 lands, so the Giant goes to hand and the lands to the bottom; her Llanowar Elves dying the same turn triggers nothing. Turn 3: she draws Plains (the lands went under, not on top); bob's Bears dying triggers nothing; her Savannah Lions dying reveals Gray Ogre, mana value 3, equal to her lands, onto the battlefield.",
